        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://perfectitinerary.io/greece/athens/neighborhoods/kolonaki"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits on the southern slopes of Mount Lycabettus, offering panoramic views of Athens.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolonaki"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 19th century, Kolonaki was a pastoral field with orchards and pastures, later becoming the heart of modern Athens.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.protothema.gr/2024/10/28/how-the-goat-fields-became-kolonaki-the-story-of-a-pasture-that-turned-into-an-aristocratic-neighborhood-photos/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area is served by the Kolonaki metro station on Line 3, connecting it directly to downtown Athens.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
